sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Client
  participant IA as Service Tchat · instance A
  participant RD as Redis Pub/Sub
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant IB as Service Tchat · instance B
  actor AG as Agent
  C->>IA: POST /chat/sessions → session_id
  C->>IA: WS session:join(session_id)
  AG->>IB: WS session:join(session_id)
  IB->>DB: assignAgent · status=active
  C->>IA: WS message:send
  IA->>DB: INSERT chat_messages
  IA->>RD: PUBLISH ycyw:chat:{session_id}
  RD-->>IA: pmessage
  RD-->>IB: pmessage
  IA-->>C: message:received
  IB-->>AG: message:received
